# Secrets
.env

# Python
*.pyo

# Claude loop outputs (generated at runtime)
TASK.md
fizzbuzz.py
test_fizzbuzz.py

# Claude Code
.claude.json

# Go
/masuda
# 隣のmasuda-engineを参照する開発用のworkspace（CLAUDE.md）。go.modはタグに固定する
/go.work
/go.work.sum
/dist/

# masuda init が足す行（利用者ごとの承認と、個人用の ~/.claude/ の中身）
.masuda/settings.local.json
.masuda/claude.local/

# Background-process pid files. internal/sandbox.pidPath derives these from a
# process's identity, which for virtiofsd is an absolute socket path but for
# mcp-relay used to be a bare bind:port -- landing "192.168.200.1:44907.pid"
# in whatever directory the CLI ran from. That is fixed (the relay's pid file
# now lives in the VM's own work directory), and this stays as the backstop
# for any future process whose identity isn't an absolute path.
*.pid

# ドキュメントサイト（scripts/docs-prepare.shの生成物・mkdocsの出力・ビルド用venv）
/docs/api/reference.md
/docs/user/reference/workflow-schema.md
/docs/design/release.md
/site/
/.venv-docs/

# masuda docの埋め込み（release.ymlが写す。internal/docsembed/content/README.md）
/internal/docsembed/content/md/
/internal/docsembed/content/site/
